# Next.js page SEO (Advanced-EMIS)

Read and follow repo-root **`../AGENTS.md`** (SEO workflow).

For every new/edited `page.tsx` / public `layout.tsx`:

1. Inspect existing `lib/seo*` and root metadata first.
2. Export unique `metadata` or `generateMetadata` (title, description, canonical, openGraph, twitter, robots).
3. Private app routes → `robots: { index: false, follow: false }`.
4. Update `sitemap` / `robots.txt` when adding a public indexable URL.
5. Prefer server-rendered content for indexable copy; real 404s for bad dynamic params.

Do not ship UI-only pages without metadata.
